; [DA_PORT] The pickup scene (da_pickup_anim.script): the hands play the take motion after an
; item is picked up from the ground. Hands only, no item model: the FDDA Redone pack that has
; a picked item in the hand is Proprietary on ModDB, so the motion is FDDA 0.9b's
; take_anim_enhanced (Public Domain) - the same cycle FDDA plays on a pickup.
;
; No item_visual on purpose. FDDA's bag models are rigged for Anomaly's hands; our hands are
; CoC's and the grip bone sits elsewhere, so an item would ride beside the hand.

; The seat pulls the hands 0.1 back: the cycle was authored for a lower camera.
[da_pickup_hud]
hands_position                           = 0, 0.00, -0.1
hands_position_16x9                      = 0, 0.00, -0.1
